PART A – THE HAULIX PROGRAM

1. Licence
   1.1 The Author grants you a free, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable licence to download, install and
       use HAULIX on computers you own or control, for your own personal, non-commercial use.
   1.2 Streaming, recording videos, taking screenshots and showing HAULIX in public content (for example on
       YouTube, Twitch, TikTok or Discord) is allowed and welcome, also on monetised channels.
   1.3 Using HAULIX inside a virtual trucking company (VTC) or community is allowed as long as HAULIX itself is
       not sold, rented or offered as part of a paid service.

2. Restrictions
   Unless the Author has given written permission, you may not:
   a) copy, publish, share, sell, rent, lend or otherwise distribute HAULIX or parts of it – please share the
      official download link (https://github.com/RyanTMP/Haulix/releases or https://www.haulix-logging.com);
   b) modify HAULIX, create derivative works, or publish modified versions, patches or "cracks";
   c) decompile, disassemble or reverse engineer HAULIX, except where the law expressly allows it and only to
      the extent it allows it (for example § 69e German Copyright Act for interoperability);
   d) remove or change copyright notices, licence texts or brand markings;
   e) use HAULIX, its code, name or artwork to build or promote another product or service;
   f) use HAULIX in a way that breaks the law or the rules of games, servers or services you use it with.

3. Source code
   The source code of HAULIX may be publicly visible on GitHub. Being able to see it does not give you any
   right to use, copy or modify it beyond this agreement. You may read it and report problems or suggest
   changes through GitHub issues. Contributions you submit may be used, changed and published by the Author
   as part of HAULIX without payment.

4. Ownership, name and logo
   HAULIX is protected by copyright. All rights not expressly granted in this agreement remain with the
   Author. The name "HAULIX", the HAULIX logos, the app icon and all artwork belong to the Author and may not
   be used for other products or modified versions without written permission. You may show them unchanged
   to refer to HAULIX.

5. Third-party components and games
   5.1 HAULIX contains open-source components that remain the property of their authors and are licensed to
       you under their own licences (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES). Nothing in this agreement limits your rights
       under those licences.
   5.2 HAULIX is an independent fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by SCS
       Software, TruckersMP, Discord, Steam, Microsoft or any other company. "Euro Truck Simulator 2" and
       "American Truck Simulator" are trademarks of SCS Software; all other names belong to their owners.
